### Get openai response
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "volcengine/deepseek-v4-flash",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content":"Hello"
    }
  ],
  "max_tokens": 512,
  "stream": true
}

### Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/messages
#Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "volcengine/deepseek-v4-flash",
  "max_tokens": 256,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "请用一句中文解释什么是向量数据库。"
    }
  ],
  "stream": true
}